<h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="how-this-registry-is-maintained" aria-labelledby="_R_189deehkd74t9_"><a href="#how-this-registry-is-maintained" class="anchor-link" aria-label="Navigate to header: How this registry is maintained"></a><span id="_R_189deehkd74t9_" class="cursor-pointer">How this registry is maintained</span></h2>
